1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,197
Step three.

2
00:00:01,197 --> 00:00:04,739
Back to our stem, four years old, its skin torn.

3
00:00:04,739 --> 00:00:11,380
A second lateral meristem now appears in the outer cortex, or the hypodermis.

4
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:15,429
Cells there dedifferentiate into the cork cambium, the phellogen.

